# Vow to Erebor: "Untap target creature you control. It gets +2/+2 until end of turn. If it's a Dwarf, you may attach an
# Equipment you control to it." Bastion Enforcer (a Dwarf Soldier, 3/2) attacks on turn 3 and is untapped by the Vow, becomes
# 5/4 and takes one Equipment of the two Bot1 controls - "an Equipment", so both together are refused (CR 701.3a): the Ghostfire
# Blade (+2/+2) makes it 7/6 and Lavaspur Boots stay unattached. It deals 7, Bot2 20 -> 13. The mana is paid exactly.

